<title>SPAIN: BCH consortium says Renfe in Retevision bid.</title>
<headline>BCH consortium says Renfe in Retevision bid.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The consortium formed by Banco Central Hispano, France Telecom, Deutsche Telekom and U.S. Sprint said on Monday it had made a deal with Spanish railways operator Renfe to bid for Retevision, a consortium spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>The deal was reported this morning by newspaper El Pais. According to the report, Renfe would be interested in making available its fiber optic network to the consortium.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
